  "subtitle": "Wholemeal spaghetti with roasted aubergine and vegetable-rich tomato sauce",
  "description": "Roasted aubergine, crisp sage, hazelnuts, and vegetarian hard cheese complement wholemeal spaghetti in a savory tomato and vegetable sauce.",
